  "body": "Rare opportunity to buy TWO adjacent units with adjoining doors in the Spencer on Byron, Takapuna Beach.\r\nTake just one of them if you like, but we think you should jump at the opportunity to buy BOTH!\r\nLive in one and rent the other.\r\nRent them both separately to supercharge your income.\r\nMake a guest room, a games room, a storage room, a relaxation room - use your imagination!\r\n\r\nThe Spencer on Byron is perhaps the most popular apartment complex on the North Shore - and for good reason.\r\nEnjoy resort style facilities including a pool, spa, gym and even tennis court.\r\nA doddle to the beach and to some fabulous bars, restaurants and cafes.\r\nTransport links a plenty too.\r\n\r\nInterconnecting units don't come up for sale often, we encourage your urgent attention here.\r\nCall James Mairs for more info.",
